  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"WordSection1\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">不朽鬼婆芭芭</span>·<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">雅嘎的造物违逆了凡间魔法的法则。在她所有臭名昭著的劳什子里，让她在无尽</span><span class=\"GramE\">的诸界中</span>巩固传奇恶名的神器乃是能够助她穿越位面的：<em>芭芭·雅嘎</em><span class=\"GramE\"><em>的臼与杵</em></span><em>Baba Yaga</em><span class=\"GramE\"><em>’</em></span><em>s Mortar and Pestle</em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。这两件芭芭</span>·<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">雅</span><span class=\"GramE\">嘎</span>特色鲜明的工具各是一件需要同调的单一神器。若两物件分开，那么<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>杵Pestle</em></span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">会在下一个黎明出现在</span><span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>臼Mortar</em></span> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">旁边。</span>  <br><br><em><strong>随机属性</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。这件神器具有以下随机属性，你可以通过对着<em>《地下城主指南》</em>中的</span>“<span class=\"bbccolor\"><em>神器</em></span> ”<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">章节掷</span><span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>以决定它们。</p><ul><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">两项弱效增益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项强效增益属性</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;tab-stops:list 36.0pt;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一项弱效减益属性</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br><em><strong>臼的属性</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。臼是一个微型的小木碗。然而，臼的大小会随着你放进去的任何需要它容纳的东西而扩展、增大至其上限大型</span>——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">如果它周围的空间足够的话。这意味着它甚至装得下一个大型生物。</span><br><em><strong>杵的属性</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。</span><span class=\"GramE\">杵是一根</span>六英尺长的破木棍。每回合一次，当你持握着杵时，你可以使其伸长至一根长棍或使其缩回一根杵（无需动作）。作为长棍时，<span class=\"GramE\">杵是一个</span>在攻击掷<span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>与伤害掷<span class=\"GramE\">骰</span>上有+3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">加值的魔法武器。</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">杵有</span>12<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能。当你</span><span class=\"GramE\">使用杵并以</span>一次近战攻击命中时，你可以消耗至多3<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">发充能以额外造成每发充能</span>1d8<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">力场伤害。杵在每天黎明时恢复所有已消耗的充能。</span><br><em><strong>完美工具</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当你同时持握着</span><span class=\"GramE\">杵与臼</span>时，你可以用动作来说出任何一种非魔法的植物、矿物或液体的名字，这些材料的价格需为10gp<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">或更低。</span><span class=\"GramE\">臼</span>立刻会充满指定价格数的那种材料。使用后，直到完成<span class=\"GramE\">一</span>次长休前，你无法再次使用这个动作。<br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">你还可以将这件神器作为炼金工具，酿酒工具，厨师工具，草药工具或</span><span class=\"GramE\">毒师工具</span>使用。你在将这件神器作为以上几种工具使用时所进行的任何检定上具有优势。<br><em><strong>原初分解</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当杵和</span><span class=\"GramE\">臼都</span>在你的5<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">尺之内时，作为一个动作，你可以命令</span><span class=\"GramE\">杵</span>开始捣碎作业。杵会自行行动，将臼中容纳的物品捣成均能够<span class=\"GramE\">同等用于</span>烹调或炼金的浆糊或精细粉末，持续1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">分钟或你用一个动作来口头命令它停止。在你的回合开始时，任何处于臼内的东西会受到</span>4d10<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">力场伤害。若目标生命</span><span class=\"GramE\">值因此</span>降至0<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">，则其会被捣成适宜的粉末、肉</span><span class=\"GramE\">浆或者</span>浆糊。只有魔法物品不受影响。若你愿意，你可以在<span class=\"GramE\">杵停止</span>工作时让臼把它的内容物分开成不同堆，比如骨粉和骨粉放在一起，药末与药末堆在一起，尚在搏动的机体器官堆在一起。<br><em><strong>黑夜穿梭</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。若你在臼内持握着杵，你可以用动作发出口头命令，</span><span class=\"GramE\">让臼穿穿梭</span>到一处特定的地点或一个特定的生物处。你不需要知道你的目标在什么位置，但你的目标必须是一个特定的位置——<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">不可以仅仅是</span>“<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">最近的河流</span>”<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">或</span>“<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">一条红龙的巢穴</span>”<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。若被选定的目标在你的</span>1000<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">英里内，</span><span class=\"GramE\">臼就会飞</span>向空中而后消失。你与任何处于臼内的生物会穿过一道梦境般的天穹，朦胧的世界映像在你的下方闪过。其他生物可能看见你在夜空中穿梭于你的原点与目标位置之间的影像。你会在1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">小时后，或在夜间</span>1<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">分钟后到达目的地。</span><br><em><strong>死马识途</strong></em><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">。当你在命令</span><span class=\"GramE\">臼</span>穿行之时，你可以转而掷出一把附着<span class=\"GramE\">在臼底的</span>粉末或肉浆，然后说出一个其他存在位面的位置或物质位面的一个其他世界。若那材料来自于那个位面或世界的一个生物，<span class=\"GramE\">那么臼上的</span>旅行者会穿过一道纯净的夜空，而后在一分钟内出现在目标位置的一处未被占据的位置。<br><em><strong>摧毁臼和</strong></em><span class=\"GramE\"><em><strong>杵</strong></em></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT:normal;FONT-STYLE:normal\"><em><strong>。</strong></em></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">若杵和</span><span class=\"GramE\">臼被</span>芭芭·<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">雅嘎的步行小屋或芭芭</span>·<span style=\"FONT-SIZE:11pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-ascii-font-family:Arial;mso-hansi-font-family:Arial\">雅</span><span class=\"GramE\">嘎本鬼</span>婆踩在底下并被挤压，它们会被摧毁。<br></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
